# Local overrides for EVerest UI backend configuration.
# Distribution defaults: @EVEREST_UI_INSTALL_BACKEND_DEFAULTS@
# Only keys written here override defaults. Updates must preserve this file.
# Remove a local directive to inherit its distribution default again.
# key= sets an explicitly empty value; !key removes an inherited key.
# Empty values may trigger a setting's built-in fallback rather than disable it.
# Examples (uncomment only the settings you want to override):
# backend_port=9002
# available_features=none
# !network_device_whitelist.chargebyte,imx93-charge-control-y
